        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Horizon is a good brand for buyers who want a no-subscription
            treadmill backed by a large manufacturer and a lifetime frame and motor warranty.</strong>
            Its weaknesses are specific: no published motor ratings, short parts and labour cover on the
            cheaper models, apps that cannot drive the machine, and a parent company with a recall and a
            reporting penalty on the record.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Choose by deck, weight rating with margin and parts cover, check the serial on any older
            T101, and register the machine when it arrives. When you are ready to pick a model, our
